## Key Types and Structs

All metrics are package-level `var` blocks in
`pkg/monitoring/metrics/forklift-controller/metrics.go`, registered via `promauto`
(no manual `prometheus.Register` for controller metrics).

Recording functions:

| Function | Started by | File |
|----------|-----------|------|
| `RecordPlanMetrics(client)` | Plan controller `Add()` | `plan_metrics.go` |
| `RecordMigrationMetrics(client)` | Migration controller `Add()` | `migration_metrics.go` |
| `RecordXcopyMetrics(client)` | Migration controller `Add()` | `xcopy_metrics.go` |

