## Metrics Defined

### Counters

| Metric | Labels | Purpose |
|--------|--------|---------|
| `mtv_migrations_status_total` | status, provider, mode, target | Terminal migration counts |
| `mtv_workload_migrations_status_total` | status, provider, mode, target, plan | Same, correlated to plan UID |
| `mtv_planned_vms_total` | provider, mode, target | VMs listed in plan specs (once per planUID/vmID) |
| `mtv_migrated_vms_total` | status, provider, mode, target | Per-VM terminal outcomes within migrations |

### Gauges

| Metric | Labels | Purpose |
|--------|--------|---------|
| `mtv_plans_status` | status, provider, mode, target | Current plan counts (reset stale combos to 0) |
| `mtv_plan_alert_status` | status, provider, mode, target, plan, plan_name, phase | Per-plan alerting (1=active; deleted when resolved) |
| `mtv_migration_duration_seconds` | provider, mode, target, plan | Duration of completed migrations |
| `mtv_migration_data_transferred_bytes` | provider, mode, target, plan | Bytes transferred (MiB × 1024² from task progress) |
| `mtv_vsphere_xcopy_volume_populator_copy_duration_seconds` | result, migration, owner_uid, storage_vendor, clone_method, xcopy_used, storage_protocol, vib_version | Copy-offload duration per disk |
| `mtv_vsphere_xcopy_volume_populator_source_disk_bytes` | above + type | Source disk size (`provisioned` or `datastore_allocated`) |

### Histograms

| Metric | Labels | Buckets |
|--------|--------|---------|
| `mtv_migrations_duration_seconds` | provider, mode, target | 1h, 2h, 5h, 10h, 24h, 48h (seconds) |

