## Label Value Constants

```
status:   Succeeded, Failed, Executing, Running, Pending, Canceled, Completed, Blocked, Ready, Deleted
provider: openshift, vsphere, ovirt, openstack, ova, ec2, hyperv  (from ProviderType.String())
mode:     Cold, Warm, Live
target:   Local (dest URL empty), Remote (dest URL set)
result:   success, failure  (xcopy metrics)
clone_method: vib, vddk
xcopy_used: 0, 1
storage_protocol: iscsi, fc, nfs
type: provisioned, datastore_allocated  (xcopy disk bytes)
```

