## Collection Loops

All three loops run as background goroutines, polling every **10 seconds**.

### Plan Metrics — `RecordPlanMetrics`

1. List all `Plan` resources
2. Resolve source/destination `Provider` → provider type, mode (`Cold`/`Warm`/`Live`), target (`Local`/`Remote`)
3. Count planned VMs from `spec.vms` into `mtv_planned_vms_total` (deduped by `planUID/vmID`)
4. Check plan conditions → aggregate into `mtv_plans_status` gauge
5. Set `mtv_plan_alert_status` = 1 for active plans (Succeeded→`Completed`, Failed→error phases, Executing)
6. During Executing: sum `DiskTransfer`/`DiskTransferV2v` task progress → `mtv_migration_data_transferred_bytes`
7. Zero stale `mtv_plans_status` label combos; delete stale `mtv_plan_alert_status` label sets

### Migration Metrics — `RecordMigrationMetrics`

1. List all `Migration` resources
2. Resolve parent `Plan` and its providers
3. Terminal states (Succeeded, Failed, Canceled): increment counters once per migration UID (in-memory dedup maps)
4. On Succeeded: record duration (`Started`→`Completed`) to gauge + histogram; sum data transferred
5. Per-VM terminal states → `mtv_migrated_vms_total` (deduped by `migrationUID/vmID/status`)

### XCOPY Metrics — `RecordXcopyMetrics`

1. List `VSphereXcopyVolumePopulator` CRs with label `forklift.konveyor.io/offload-completed=true`
2. Skip if `status.result` is empty or UID already processed
3. Read `status.copyDurationSeconds`, `provisionedBytes`, `allocatedBytes`
4. Set `mtv_vsphere_xcopy_volume_populator_*` gauges with storage metadata from status
5. Dedup via `processedXcopyCompletions` map keyed by populator UID

