## Reconciliation / Execution Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph controllers [Controller startup]
        PC[Plan controller Add] --> RPM[RecordPlanMetrics goroutine]
        MC[Migration controller Add] --> RMM[RecordMigrationMetrics goroutine]
        MC --> RXM[RecordXcopyMetrics goroutine]
    end
    subgraph registry [Default Prometheus registry]
        RPM --> GAUGES[mtv_plans_status / alerts / planned_vms]
        RMM --> COUNTERS[mtv_migrations_* / migrated_vms_*]
        RXM --> XCOPY[mtv_vsphere_xcopy_*]
    end
    subgraph scrape [Prometheus scrape]
        GAUGES --> EP[":8080/metrics via kube-rbac-proxy :8443"]
        COUNTERS --> EP
        XCOPY --> EP
    end
```

---

## Key Design Decisions

- **Polling, not event-driven:** Metrics recalculated on a fixed 10s interval, not via controller watches
- **In-memory deduplication:** Maps prevent double-counting within a pod lifetime; counters may re-increment after pod restart
- **Stale label cleanup:** Plan gauges zero out absent combos; alert gauges delete stale label sets entirely
- **Data transfer units:** Task `Progress.Completed` is in MiB; multiplied by 1024² to get bytes
- **Separate populator metrics:** `vsphere-copy-offload-populator` binary has its own metrics package in `cmd/vsphere-copy-offload-populator/internal/metrics/` (not covered here)

